      "fullDescription": [
        "Nuaire is a UK ventilation brand established in 1966 and based operationally in Caerphilly, South Wales. Current official terms identify it as a trading division of Polypipe Limited, while Genuit Group lists Nuaire among its businesses and records the acquisition of the ventilation business in 2015. Nuaire designs and manufactures systems for domestic, commercial and industrial construction sectors.",
        "The official portfolio ranges from positive input ventilation, mechanical ventilation with heat recovery and centralised or decentralised extract systems to commercial heat-recovery and air-handling units. It also covers single, twin, small, roof and AXUS axial fans, car-park ventilation and smoke-extract fans, ducting and ancillary equipment. Nuaire documents applications across housing, commercial buildings, industrial facilities, schools, healthcare environments and car parks."
